      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "PRO",
          "chapter": 14,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "There is a way which seems right to a man, but in the end it leads to death.",
      "ko": "어떤 길은 사람의 보기에 바르나 필경은 사망의 길이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5a351172774025f949b7a25c40ac0957aed4d8749fe888dfbe2feee099dc2fb3",
      "translation_text_hash": "f5549fd9deb75a32f22739d625cc47fdbcfa47e3e31aababd766ff71f5eeff55",
